{"acronym":"ACHIEVE-RAM","arm_groups":[{"intervention_names":["Drug: Orforglipron"],"label":"Orforglipron","type":"EXPERIMENTAL"}],"brief_summary":"The purpose of this study is to test the efficacy and safety of orforglipron in participants with T2D (type 2 diabetes) who participate in fasting during Ramadan. For each participant, the study will last up to 48 weeks with a minimum of 7 in clinic visits and 4 virtual visits.","brief_title":"A Study of Orforglipron (LY3502970) in Participants With Type 2 Diabetes Who Observe Ramadan Fasting","collaborators":[],"completion_date":{"date":"2027-05","type":"ESTIMATED"},"conditions":["Diabetes Mellitus, Type 2","Diabetes Melletus","Glucose Metabolism Disorders","Metabolic Disorders","Nutritional and Metabolic Diseases","Endocrine System Diseases","Feeding Behavior","Behavior","Fasting","Glucagon-Like Peptide-1 Receptor","Glucagon-Like Peptide Receptors","Receptors, G-Protein-Coupled","Receptors, Cell Surface","Membrane Proteins","Proteins","Receptors, Peptide"],"design":{"allocation":"NA","intervention_model":"SINGLE_GROUP","masking":"NONE","primary_purpose":"TREATMENT","who_masked":[]},"eligibility":{"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have a clinical diagnosis of T2D based on the World Health Organization (WHO) classification or other locally applicable diagnostic standards.\n* Have an HbA1c value of at least 7.0% (53 millimoles per mole (mmol/mol)) to less than 9.5% (91 mmol/mol) at screening.\n* Intend to be compliant with the fast during the Ramadan period.\n* Have had stable body weight self-reported change of 5 kilograms (kg) or lower during the 90 days prior to screening.\n* Have body mass index (BMI) of 25 kilograms per meter square (kg/m2) or higher at screening.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Have any form of diabetes other than T2D, including type 1 diabetes (T1D), gestational diabetes, latent autoimmune diabetes, maturity-onset diabetes of the young, and medication-induced diabetes\n* Have a family (first-degree relative) or personal history of medullary thyroid carcinoma or multiple endocrine neoplasia syndrome type 2.\n* Have a history of chronic or acute pancreatitis any time prior to screening\n* Have evidence of a significant, uncontrolled endocrine abnormality, for example, thyrotoxic or adrenal crises, in the opinion of the investigator\n* Have a history of an active or untreated malignancy or are in remission from a clinically significant malignancy for less than 5 years.\n* Have a history of cholecystectomy (surgically removed gallbladder)\n* Have New York Heart Association Functional Classification IV congestive heart-failure.","healthy_volunteers":false,"maximum_age":"65 Years","minimum_age":"18 Years","sex":"ALL","std_ages":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"]},"enrollment":{"count":130,"type":"ESTIMATED"},"first_posted":"2026-05-29","has_results":false,"interventions":[{"name":"Orforglipron","other_names":["LY3502970"],"type":"DRUG"}],"last_known_status":null,"last_update_posted":"2026-10-08","lead_sponsor":{"class":"INDUSTRY","name":"Eli Lilly and Company"},"nct_id":"NCT07613307","official_title":"A Phase 3b, Multicenter, Multi-Country, Open-Label, Single-Arm Study to Investigate the Efficacy and Safety of Orforglipron in Adult Participants With Type 2 Diabetes Who Observe Ramadan Fasting (ACHIEVE-RAM)","overall_status":"RECRUITING","phases":["PHASE3"],"primary_completion_date":{"date":"2027-05","type":"ESTIMATED"},"primary_outcomes":[{"measure":"Change from Baseline in Hemoglobin A1C (HbA1c)","time_frame":"Baseline, up to 8 Weeks after Start of Ramadan"}],"results_first_posted":null,"sites":[{"city":"Agra","country":"India","facility":"Sarojini Naidu Medical College","lat":27.18333,"lon":78.01667,"state":null,"status":"RECRUITING"},{"city":"Hyderabad","country":"India","facility":"Osmania General Hospital","lat":17.38405,"lon":78.45636,"state":null,"status":"RECRUITING"},{"city":"Kanpur","country":"India","facility":"Brij Medical Centre Pvt. Ltd.","lat":26.46523,"lon":80.